{
  "an8.9:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 8.9 ",
  "an8.9:0.2": "1. Love ",
  "an8.9:0.3": "Nanda ",
  "an8.9:1.1": "“Mendicants, you could rightly call Nanda ‘Gentleman’, ",
  "an8.9:1.2": "‘strong’, ",
  "an8.9:1.3": "‘lovely’, ",
  "an8.9:1.4": "and ‘lustful’. ",
  "an8.9:1.5": "How could he live the full and pure spiritual life unless he guards the sense doors, eats in moderation, is dedicated to wakefulness, and has mindfulness and situational awareness? ",
  "an8.9:1.6": "This is how Nanda guards the sense doors. ",
  "an8.9:1.7": "If he has to look to the east, he wholeheartedly concentrates before looking, thinking: ",
  "an8.9:1.8": "‘When I look to the east, bad, unskillful qualities of covetousness and displeasure will not overwhelm me.’ ",
  "an8.9:1.9": "In this way he’s aware of the situation. ",
  "an8.9:2.1": "If he has to look to the west … ",
  "an8.9:2.2": "north … ",
  "an8.9:2.3": "south … ",
  "an8.9:2.4": "up … ",
  "an8.9:2.5": "down … ",
  "an8.9:2.6": "If he has to survey the intermediate directions, he wholeheartedly concentrates before looking, thinking: ",
  "an8.9:2.7": "‘When I survey the intermediate directions, bad, unskillful qualities of covetousness and displeasure will not overwhelm me.’ ",
  "an8.9:2.8": "In this way he’s aware of the situation. ",
  "an8.9:2.9": "This is how Nanda guards the sense doors. ",
  "an8.9:3.1": "This is how Nanda eats in moderation. ",
  "an8.9:3.2": "Nanda reflects rationally on the food he eats: ",
